# Sparky for Arduino: a traffic light.
# Red LED on pin 12, yellow on 11, green on 10 (each with a 220 ohm resistor to GND).

set red to 12
set yellow to 11
set green to 10

teach light led time
  pin led on
  wait time
  pin led off
end

forever
  do light red 3
  do light green 3
  do light yellow 1
end
